# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .easignore — EAS Build upload exclusions for MedGuard AI
#
# EAS Build uploads your project directory to Expo's cloud servers.
# Everything listed here is EXCLUDED from that upload, shrinking
# the archive from ~12 GB to well under 200 MB.
#
# Rules mirror .gitignore syntax. EAS also respects .gitignore
# automatically, but .easignore takes precedence and can add more.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Node modules (rebuilt on the EAS server from package.json) ──
node_modules/

# ── ML training folder — primary cause of 12GB build size ───────
# Contains: DATASET_0.zip (1.2GB), DATASET_1.zip (2.2GB),
#           4× PyTorch checkpoints (.pth, 332MB each),
#           PAD-UFES-20 patient images (hundreds of PNGs)
# The ONLY ML file the app needs is assets/models/medguard_v3.tflite
ml/

# ── ML training artifacts (anywhere in the project) ─────────────
*.ipynb
*.ipynb_checkpoints/
medguard_policy.json
medguard-3-2-fixed*/
*.pth
*.h5
*.keras
*.pb
*.ckpt*
*.tfrecord
*.parquet
*.csv
checkpoints/
saved_models/

# ── Stitch / Figma design exports ───────────────────────────────
# These are UI design reference files, not app code.
stitch_medguard_ai_mobile_system/

# ── Product documentation ────────────────────────────────────────
01_Product_Overview.md
02_Features_Requirements.md
03_UI_UX_Requirements.md
04_Technical_Requirements.md
DESIGN.md

# ── Test & debug scripts ─────────────────────────────────────────
tests/
scripts/
*.test.ts
*.test.js
*.spec.ts
*.spec.js
probe_imports.js
reset-project.js
verify_encryption.js
verify_encryption.py
verify_orchestrator.js
.test_output/

# ── Local environment & secrets (never ship to cloud) ───────────
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env*.local

# ── Build outputs & caches ───────────────────────────────────────
dist/
web-build/
.expo/
.metro-cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
android/
ios/

# ── OS / editor artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.orig.*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Git ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore

# ── Misc large files unlikely to be needed ───────────────────────
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.rar
*.7z
*.csv
*.parquet
*.jsonl

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT ignore these — they ARE needed for the build:
#   src/              (app source code)
#   assets/           (images, fonts, tflite model)
#   app.json          (Expo config)
#   package.json      (dependencies)
#   tsconfig.json     (TypeScript config)
#   metro.config.js   (Metro bundler — tflite asset registration)
#   eas.json          (EAS build profiles)
#   babel.config.js   (if present)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
